## 3. Analysis of Items #9 (`skip_barrier`) and #10 / K2 (Wave/LDS Occupancy A/B)

- **Item #9 (`skip_barrier` outside `flow`)**:
  - In `Engine::record_net` (`gpu/src/engine.cpp:567-572`), the only two independent consecutive dispatches (`pooled_history2` writing `pdst_` and `ae` writing `expo_[cur]`/`blk_`) already omit the UAV barrier between them (`d.barrier()` is issued only after `ae`).
  - All other dispatches outside the 10-kernel `enc2..dec2_1` flow chain (`enc0_attr -> enc0_stage_32_64 -> enc1`, and `dec2_1 -> dec1_0 -> dec1_1 -> dec0_0 -> dec0_1 -> post -> downsample`) have strict full-tensor RAW dependencies on the immediately preceding kernel's output buffer; skipping any of those UAV barriers would cause data races.
- **Item #10 / K2 (Top-5 hottest dispatches & `LDS_OCC_PAD=8192` A/B at 1080p & 4K)**:
  - `asi/build/build_shaders.py` and `gpu/fastmode.cmake` enable `LDS_OCC_PAD=8192` selectively on the three `W1` (`C=32`, 1 wave32/WG) kernels (`enc0_stage_32_64`, `dec_up_32_64_64`, `dec_head_32_64`), while leaving `post` and `enc_stage_64_64_96` unpadded.
  - Both 1080p (`diff_words=0/8294400`) and 4K (`diff_words=0/33177600`) produce 100% bit-exact outputs:
    - **1080p Quality (`1280x720 -> 1920x1080`)**: Engine steady-state `Fast(_lt+flow+W1_occ16K)` `p50 = 3.115–3.163 ms` (`sum = 3.21 ms` vs `3.46 ms` prior), `Legacy` `p50 = 3.426–3.440 ms`, DRS `p50 = 3.019 ms`; `W1(C=32 x3)` sum improves by `-5.0%` (`1064.6 us -> 1011.7 us`).
    - **4K Quality (`2560x1440 -> 3840x2160`)**: Engine steady-state `Fast(_lt+flow+W1_occ16K)` `p50 = 11.904 ms` (`p95 = 12.097 ms`, `sum = 11.78 ms` vs `12.15 ms` prior), `Legacy` `p50 = 13.151 ms` (`-9.5%` Fast vs Legacy).

